            "title": "what is your return policy?",
            "content": "<p>We hope you love your Summer Fridays products, however we understand that sometimes things don’t work out. We accept returns on new or gently used items purchased from www.SummerFridays.com within 30 days purchase. </p><p>If you have purchased a product from one of our authorized retail partners, please follow that retailer’s return policy. </p><p>Please note, all gift cards and select merchandise purchased on <a href=\"https://summerfridays.com/\" title=\"https://summerfridays.com/\">SummerFridays.com</a> are final sale.</p>"
          }
