        "accordion_cbCcfW": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I make an exchange?",
            "content": "<p>We allow exchanges on select items on SummerFridays.com. To check if your item is eligible for an exchange, click <a href=\"https://summerfridays.happyreturns.com/\" title=\"https://summerfridays.happyreturns.com/\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">here</span></a>, enter the email address that you used when you made your purchase along with your shipping zip code and click “Start Your Return”.  </p><p>Once you access the Return Portal, please choose which item you would like to exchange and select the reason for return. If your product is eligible, you will see the option to exchange for a similar item. </p>"
